WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.014
Is India federal?

2
00:00:02.014 --> 00:00:03.630
Mostly, but with a strong

3
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.602
centre.

4
00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:06.553
K. C.

5
00:00:06.553 --> 00:00:09.124
Wheare called India quasi-federal.

6
00:00:09.124 --> 00:00:10.295
Federal in form,

7
00:00:10.295 --> 00:00:12.596
with a strong unitary pull.

8
00:00:13.271 --> 00:00:16.009
The Centre holds residuary powers.

9
00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:18.192
Emergencies can turn the system

10
00:00:18.192 --> 00:00:20.923
unitary. There is one constitution,

11
00:00:20.923 --> 00:00:22.108
one citizenship,

12
00:00:22.108 --> 00:00:24.090
and all-India services.

13
00:00:24.436 --> 00:00:27.000
Granville Austin called the Constitution

14
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.123
a seamless web of national

15
00:00:29.123 --> 00:00:32.345
unity, democracy and social revolution.

16
00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:34.323
Your turn.

17
00:00:34.323 --> 00:00:36.962
Who called India quasi-federal?
